LIBERTY IN THE CORALVERSE  (25 seconds · 8K · 30fps · Filament-Coral Hyperrealism · Heroic Cinematic)

STYLE & VISUAL WORLD

A reimagined Manhattan made of coral-like, filament-textured structures — skyscrapers bloom like living reefs; streets ripple with layered contour lines; colors shift in oceanic gradients (amber, teal, crimson).
The Statue of Liberty is a towering, semi-living guardian made of carved coral-gold biomaterial, glowing from within.
Tone: Epic, mythic, heroic, dimensional.
Camera style: Bold heroic cuts + flying shots + micro-wind ripples + slow-to-fast speed ramps.

GLOBAL MOTION RULES (Keep these for Sora consistency)
No still frames: coral filaments flow constantly.
Micro-wind affects all surfaces.
Torch is always emitting bioluminescent particles.
Skyscrapers subtly pulse like living coral.
Storm energy distorts space lightly (chromatic ribbons).

0.0–0.2s — ANCHOR (very quick)

Macro filament shot: swirling coral ridges forming Manhattan’s coastline.
Soft glow pulses once.

0.2–2.2s — SCENE 1 — The Guardian Reveals

Heroic rising shot of the Statue of Liberty, towering over coral Manhattan.
Her torch glows with bioluminescent fire.
Filament terrain gently ripples beneath her.

Tone: mythic, majestic.

2.2–4.2s — SCENE 2 — The Call of the Torch

Liberty tilts her torch upward.
A wave of golden-light energy spreads across the city, igniting coral skyscrapers with shimmering highlights.

FX: sweeping energy ribbon, glowing contour lines.

4.2–6.2s — SCENE 3 — Heroic Fly-Into Manhattan

Camera flies from Liberty’s height straight into the city.
We skim over flowing coral hills → dive between skyscrapers made of colorful, organic filaments.

Motion: smooth but fast, epic POV.

6.2–8.2s — SCENE 4 — The Living Streets

Street-level dolly through a coralized Manhattan avenue.
Signs, cars, sidewalks all pulse as if alive.
Coral dust drifts in shafts of light.

Tone: immersive, otherworldly.

8.2–10.2s — SCENE 5 — Footfall of a Titan

Cut back upward: Liberty takes a monumental step forward.
The ground bends and ripples like fabric struck by a wave.
Skyscrapers gently sway in response.

FX: soft shockwave distortion.

10.2–12.2s — SCENE 6 — Vertical Ascension

Camera rockets upward between coral skyscrapers.
Color gradients shift from warm reds to cool blues as we climb.
Particles trail behind the camera.

Tone: rising action.

12.2–14.2s — SCENE 7 — Storm Over Manhattan

Above the skyline: a dimensional vortex forms in the clouds.
Fractal lightning curls inward.
The city below glows in anticipation.

FX: swirling geometry, light ribbons.

14.2–16.2s — SCENE 8 — Beacon of Stability

Liberty raises her torch high.
The beam shoots into the vortex, stabilizing it.
Clouds fold back like petals.

Tone: triumphant, heroic.

16.2–18.2s — SCENE 9 — Coral Rebirth

A sweeping aerial pass over Manhattan as the coral terrain glows warm gold.
Skyscrapers return to calm, breathing slowly.

Motion: gentle cinematic glide.

18.2–20.2s — SCENE 10 — The Guardian’s Close-Up

Hero close-up of Liberty’s coral face.
Filaments shift like living armor.
The torch flickers with soft afterglow.

Tone: calm resolution.

20.2–24.0s — SCENE 11 — The Reborn City (Final Panorama)

Epic wide shot from high above Manhattan.
Coral city shimmers in soft light, peaceful now.
Camera slowly pulls back toward the clouds.

Motion: majestic, peaceful pull-away.

